 carry the load at catcher. While we would ideally utilize the wheels of **Jung Hoo Lee** (49.14) against the slow delivery of Be Brown to hunt for the scarce stolen bases we prioritize, the overall team focus is on maintaining high daily efficiency scores to protect our game caps against a challenging set of opposing arms.",
